; Collect every Markdown heading into the clipboard, one per line.
;
; An Extract task never changes the file: it gathers what it matches and
; puts it on the clipboard, separated by Divider. The default divider is a
; form feed and a newline; this one asks for a plain newline instead.

[headings]
Find="^#{1,6} +.*$"
Options="Multiline"
Extract="1"
Divider="\n"
